* ALOG1 -- On-air log screen
MAP ALOG1 SIZE 24x80
  FIELD HEADER    AT 0,2   LEN 40 PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD USERID    AT 0,70  LEN 8  PROT DIM    COLOR=TURQUOISE
  FIELD LOGDATE   AT 3,20  LEN 8  UNPROT BRIGHT COLOR=WHITE
  FIELD AIREDCT   AT 6,30  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=GREEN
  FIELD MISSEDCT  AT 7,30  LEN 5  PROT BRIGHT COLOR=YELLOW
  FIELD FOOTER    AT 23,2  LEN 60 PROT DIM    COLOR=BLUE
ENDMAP
